#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:1
msgid "llvm-as - LLVM assembler"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:8
msgid "**llvm-as** \\[*options*\\] \\[*filename*\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:12
msgid ""
"**llvm-as** is the LLVM assembler. It reads a file containing human-readable "
"LLVM assembly language, translates it to LLVM bitcode, and writes the result "
"into a file or to standard output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:16
msgid ""
"If *filename* is omitted or is `-`, then **llvm-as** reads its input from "
"standard input."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:19
msgid ""
"If an output file is not specified with the **-o** option, then **llvm-as** "
"sends its output to a file or standard output by following these rules:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:23
msgid "If the input is standard input, then the output is standard output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:24
msgid ""
"If the input is a file that ends with `.ll`, then the output file is of the "
"same name, except that the suffix is changed to `.bc`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:26
msgid ""
"If the input is a file that does not end with the `.ll` suffix, then the "
"output file has the same name as the input file, except that the `.bc` "
"suffix is appended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:30
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:32
msgid "**-f**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:34
msgid ""
"Enable binary output on terminals. Normally, **llvm-as** will refuse to "
"write raw bitcode output if the output stream is a terminal. With this "
"option, **llvm-as** will write raw bitcode regardless of the output device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:38
msgid "**-help**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:40
msgid "Print a summary of command line options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:42
msgid "**-o** *filename*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:44
msgid ""
"Specify the output file name. If *filename* is `-`, then **llvm-as** sends "
"its output to standard output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:47
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:49
msgid ""
"If **llvm-as** succeeds, it will exit with 0. Otherwise, if an error occurs, "
"it will exit with a non-zero value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-as.md:52
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr ""

